# Secrets

Never commit `.env`, API keys, JWT secrets, OAuth secrets, or private keys.
Never put provider keys in React, `localStorage`, `sessionStorage`, Vite `VITE_*` vars, or client state.

Allowed in the client: `VITE_API_BASE_URL` and other non-secret public config.

Provider keys live in server env or encrypted MongoDB fields.
API responses may return masked keys only (`sk-••••1234`), never raw secrets.
Never log passwords, tokens, API keys, or prompt bodies that contain credentials.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — client
const key = import.meta.env.VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY;

// ✅ GOOD — server only
const key = env.GEMINI_API_KEY;
```
